#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum algorithms skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Kumuha ng pagsusulit na may 20 tanong sa IBM Training site para subukan ang iyong mga kasanayan sa quantum algorithms at makatanggap ng badge sa pamamagitan ng Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam for Fundamentals of quantum algorithms"
msgstr "Pagsusulit para sa Mga Pangunahing Kaalaman sa Quantum Algorithms"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit at badge {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, intermediate level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Isang square badge na nagsasaad ng pangalan ng kursong ito, intermediate na antas, at inilabas ng IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/exam/badge.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survey pagkatapos ng kurso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing this course! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_43oo99mkThQFIFM). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Binabati kita sa pagkumpleto ng kursong ito! Mangyaring maglaan ng sandali para tulungan kaming pahusayin ang aming kurso sa pamamagitan ng pagsagot sa sumusunod na [maikling survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_43oo99mkThQFIFM). Gagamitin ang iyong feedback para pahusayin ang aming content offering at user experience. Salamat!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Fundamentals of quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM&reg; Training, kung saan maaari kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa Mga Pangunahing Kaalaman sa Quantum Algorithms.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Sa pagtanggap ng pumapasang marka, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo para mag-rehistro sa IBM Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking handa ka nang kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makapasa sa dalawang pagtatangka, pansamantalang ma-lo-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paunawa: Ang mga pagsusulit na ito sa IBM Training site ay maaaring pansamantalang hindi available sa susunod na ilang araw, dahil sa maintenance.\n"

